                <pb facs="0381" n="261" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg261"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Barrett to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-12-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Barrett reports that an official announcement has been made of the discovery
                    of a plot to dispose of the President of Colombia and to organize a new
                    government. Many prominent men who were arrested are now about to undergo trial
                    by court-matrial. Among the leaders are a former cabinet minister and
                    generals.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
